<title>UK: Caixa de Cataluna sets 20 bln PTA domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Caixa de Cataluna sets 20 bln PTA domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by sole lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAIXA DE CATALUNA</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN PTA    COUPON   * 6.54	MATURITY    07.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  15 BP     LISTING    AIAF	DENOMS (M)  25</p>
<p> NOTES    * FOR FIRST TWO YEARS, 6.14 PCT THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		CALL AT PAR ON 07.MAY.99</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
